@startuml
title zmtx sender — one-file transfer detail

left to right direction
hide empty description
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  ArrowColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  StartColor #15803D
  EndColor #991B1B
}

[*] -right-> Announce

state "Announce file" as Announce
Announce : send ZFILE + metadata/ZCRCW
Announce : ZACK / ignore
Announce : first stale ZRINIT / refresh capabilities
Announce : other response or timeout [attempts < 10] / resend
Announce -right-> Position : ZRPOS(pos)
Announce -down-> Skipped : ZSKIP

state "Seek requested offset" as Position
Position : seek input file to pos
Position -right-> Stream : success / send ZDATA(pos)

state "Stream subpackets" as Stream
Stream : read, escape, CRC, and send blocks
Stream : ZCRCG / continue
Stream : ZCRCQ / request asynchronous ZACK; continue
Stream : asynchronous valid ZACK / advance acknowledged offset
Stream -down-> AwaitAck : ZCRCW or send window full
Stream -right-> EndFile : ZCRCE
Stream -up-> Retry : ZRPOS, ZNAK, or timeout
Stream -down-> Skipped : ZSKIP

state "Await required ZACK" as AwaitAck
AwaitAck : stale ZACK / keep waiting
AwaitAck : valid ZACK [window remains full] / keep waiting
AwaitAck -up-> Stream : required ZACK / advance acknowledged offset;\nreopen ZDATA frame when ZCRCW closed it
AwaitAck -right-> EndFile : required ZACK [EOF already reached]
AwaitAck -left-> Retry : ZRPOS, ZNAK, timeout,\nor invalid ACK position

state "Reduce block and retry" as Retry
Retry : use new offset when ZRPOS supplied
Retry : observe emitted offset for ZNAK or timeout
Retry : new receiver or emitted high-water position / reset attempts
Retry : no new high-water position / increment attempts
Retry : reduce current subpacket size
Retry : end first retransmitted subpacket with ZCRCW and wait
Retry -left-> Position : file attempts remain

state "Finish file" as EndFile
EndFile : send ZEOF(file size)
EndFile : ZACK or timeout [finish attempts remain] / resend
EndFile -up-> Retry : ZRPOS(pos)
EndFile -down-> Succeeded : ZRINIT
EndFile -down-> Skipped : ZSKIP

state "File succeeded" as Succeeded
state "File skipped" as Skipped
Succeeded -right-> [*]
Skipped -right-> [*]

note bottom of Stream
  ZCRCG and ZCRCQ keep the ZDATA frame open.
  ZCRCE and ZCRCW close it.
end note

note bottom of Retry
  ZRPOS supplies a new offset. ZNAK and timeout use the
  last receiver-requested offset retained by send_file().
  Their emitted offset is used only for retry accounting. Receiver
  and emitted high-water marks remain separate until ZRPOS advances.
end note

legend bottom
  Fatal protocol/local I/O errors and exhausted 10-attempt loops
  leave this state machine as a failed file transfer.
endlegend
@enduml
